{
 "id": "seg1",
 "title": "一笔日常签名",
 "pill": 1,
 "total": 46.96,
 "lines": [
  {
   "id": "seg1-00",
   "text": "2025 年 2 月，Bybit 的多签签名人，签了一笔看起来很正常的交易。",
   "spoken": "2025 年 2 月，Bybit 的多签签名人，签了一笔看起来很正常的交易。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep01/audio/lines/seg1-00.wav",
   "start": 1.6,
   "dur": 5.76,
   "speechStart": 1.6,
   "speechEnd": 7.132
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-01",
   "text": "可他们用的 Safe 钱包网页前端，已经被人篡改了。",
   "spoken": "可他们用的 Safe 钱包网页前端，已经被人篡改了。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep01/audio/lines/seg1-01.wav",
   "start": 7.58,
   "dur": 4.0,
   "speechStart": 7.58,
   "speechEnd": 11.351
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-02",
   "text": "签下去的这笔交易，替换了多签的实现合约。",
   "spoken": "签下去的这笔交易，替换了多签的实现合约。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep01/audio/lines/seg1-02.wav",
   "start": 11.8,
   "dur": 3.6,
   "speechStart": 11.892,
   "speechEnd": 15.173
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-03",
   "text": "约 15 亿美元，就这样被转走。",
   "spoken": "约 15 亿美元，就这样被转走。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep01/audio/lines/seg1-03.wav",
   "start": 15.62,
   "dur": 3.28,
   "speechStart": 15.71,
   "speechEnd": 18.749
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-04",
   "text": "先请你猜一猜。Safe 多签合约的代码，有没有被利用的漏洞？",
   "spoken": "先请你猜一猜。Safe 多签合约的代码，有没有被利用的漏洞？",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep01/audio/lines/seg1-04.wav",
   "start": 19.12,
   "dur": 4.64,
   "speechStart": 19.12,
   "speechEnd": 23.542
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-05",
   "text": "如果没有，钱又是从哪里漏出去的？",
   "spoken": "如果没有，钱又是从哪里漏出去的？",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep01/audio/lines/seg1-05.wav",
   "start": 24.26,
   "dur": 3.2,
   "speechStart": 24.26,
   "speechEnd": 27.218
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-06",
   "text": "这一集是整个系列的入口。我们要回答三个问题。",
   "spoken": "这一集是整个系列的入口。我们要回答三个问题。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep01/audio/lines/seg1-06.wav",
   "start": 27.96,
   "dur": 4.08,
   "speechStart": 28.063,
   "speechEnd": 31.816
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-07",
   "text": "合约安全和传统安全，到底哪里不一样？",
   "spoken": "合约安全和传统安全，到底哪里不一样？",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep01/audio/lines/seg1-07.wav",
   "start": 32.26,
   "dur": 3.76,
   "speechStart": 32.26,
   "speechEnd": 35.764
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-08",
   "text": "攻击会从哪些地方进来？",
   "spoken": "攻击会从哪些地方进来？",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep01/audio/lines/seg1-08.wav",
   "start": 36.52,
   "dur": 2.08,
   "speechStart": 36.612,
   "speechEnd": 38.359
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-09",
   "text": "怎么站在攻击者的角度，给一个系统建模？",
   "spoken": "怎么站在攻击者的角度，给一个系统建模？",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep01/audio/lines/seg1-09.wav",
   "start": 39.1,
   "dur": 3.36,
   "speechStart": 39.1,
   "speechEnd": 42.285
  },
  {
